In summary, by leveraging our RAG-based Atelier platform, focusing on explainability, traceability, and reliability, and adopting an iterative innovation strategy, we can design an AI assistance solution that improves productivity and quality of work while preserving professional secrecy and ensuring the reliability of figures.
